# =============================================================================
# IP PROTECTION: DO NOT REMOVE OR LOOSEN THESE RULES WITHOUT REVIEW
# =============================================================================
# This repository must never contain package data, executables, extracted
# assets, or any material owned by Twisted Pixel Games or Microsoft.
# The rules below ignore every common Xbox 360 dump and extracted-asset format.
# If you need to add a real source file whose name happens to collide, prefer
# renaming the file rather than weakening the patterns.
# =============================================================================

# --- Packages, executables and their debug files ---
*.pkg
*.xex
*.xexp
*.pe
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.xdb
*.bin
baserom/
default.xex
default.pe
58410A20*
